# Gym Membership Management SaaS — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **multi-tenant SaaS platform** for gym owners to manage members, plans, and subscriptions. Built with Next.js 16, TypeScript, MongoDB, TailwindCSS, ShadCN UI, NextAuth, Zod, and React Hook Form.

## Project Structure

```
gym-bro/
├── app/
│   ├── layout.tsx              # Root layout (providers, theme, toaster)
│   ├── page.tsx                # Root redirect (role-based)
│   ├── globals.css             # ShadCN theme (purple primary, dark mode)
│   ├── login/page.tsx          # Login page
│   ├── admin/
│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Admin sidebar layout
│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Admin dashboard (stats cards)
│   │   ├── gyms/page.tsx       # Gym list (table + mobile cards)
│   │   └── create-gym/page.tsx # Create gym form
│   ├── dashboard/
│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Gym owner sidebar layout
│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Dashboard (stats + charts)
│   │   ├── members/
│   │   │   ├── page.tsx        # Member list (search/filter/sort/paginate)
│   │   │   ├── new/page.tsx    # Add member form
│   │   │   └── [id]/page.tsx   # View/edit member
│   │   ├── plans/page.tsx      # Plans management (CRUD dialog)
│   │   └── settings/page.tsx   # Account & subscription info
│   └── api/
│       ├── auth/[...nextauth]/ # NextAuth handler
│       └── cron/expiry-check/  # Cron job for expiry notifications
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                     # 12 ShadCN components
│   ├── sidebar.tsx             # Responsive sidebar (mobile drawer)
│   ├── stats-card.tsx          # Reusable stats card
│   ├── confirm-dialog.tsx      # Delete confirmation
│   ├── empty-state.tsx         # Empty state pattern
│   ├── theme-*.tsx             # Dark mode support
│   └── auth-provider.tsx       # Session provider
├── models/                     # 4 Mongoose models
├── actions/                    # Server actions (gym, member, plan, notification)
├── lib/                        # DB, auth, utils, validations
├── types/                      # TypeScript interfaces
├── hooks/                      # useDebounce
├── scripts/seed.ts             # Admin seed script
└── middleware.ts               # Route protection
```

## Key Features

| Feature | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **Auth** | NextAuth credentials, JWT, role-based (ADMIN/GYM_OWNER) |
| **Admin Panel** | Create gyms, view list, activate/deactivate |
| **Dashboard** | Stats cards, bar chart (new members), pie chart (status) |
| **Members** | Full CRUD, search/filter/sort, pagination, bulk WhatsApp |
| **Plans** | CRUD via dialog, card grid with hover actions |
| **Responsive** | Table → card views on mobile, drawer sidebar |
| **Dark Mode** | System/manual toggle, full theme support |
| **Export** | CSV download of member list |
| **Notifications** | WhatsApp link generation, cron expiry check |
| **SaaS-Ready** | Subscription fields, member limits, free tier |

## Getting Started

1. Copy [.env.example](file:///D:/Free/product/gym-bro/.env.example) to `.env.local` and fill in your MongoDB URI
2. Run `npm run seed` to create the admin user (`admin@gymbro.com` / `admin123`)
3. Run `npm run dev` to start the dev server
4. Login as admin → create a gym → login as gym owner → manage members

