---

### Phase 11: Bulk Messaging & Automated Reminders
Bulk messaging and automated reminders have been implemented to help gym owners communicate with their members and ensure timely renewals.

#### 1. Notification Services
- **Email Service**: Uses Nodemailer with SMTP configuration to send professional emails.
- **WhatsApp Service**: Integrates with the WhatsApp Business Cloud API for automated messaging.

#### 2. Automated Reminders
- A cron job (`/api/cron/expiry-check`) runs daily.
- It identifies members expiring in 10, 5, or 1 day.
- Sends both Email and WhatsApp reminders.
- Tracks all notifications in the [Notification](file:///D:/Free/product/gym-bro/models/Notification.ts#3-15) model to prevent duplicate reminders.

#### 3. Bulk Messaging UI
- Added a "Bulk Message" button to the Members page (visible when members are selected).
- Responsive dialog for composing messages.
- Support for both Email and WhatsApp message types.
- Real-time feedback on delivery status.

#### 4. Notification History
- Every message (automated or manual) is logged in the [Notification](file:///D:/Free/product/gym-bro/models/Notification.ts#3-15) model.
- Tracks recipient, content, status, and error messages for auditing.

